 dwin is in a class all his own. His signature bowtie represents his expecta
 tion-defying brand of comedy that leaves a variety of audiences - from come
 dy clubs to churches and corporate events to swanky galas - laughing hyster
 ically and completely inspired\, without a foul or vulgar word spoken.\n\nA
  native of Camden\, South Carolina\, Mike holds a master’s degree in Educ
 ation from the University of South Carolina\, is a veteran of the U.S. Army
 \, and a former primary and secondary education professional. He infuses hi
 s varied life experiences into his act\, making him relatable to audiences 
 from all walks of life.\n\nUsing his ability to merge leadership and laught
 er\, Mike is a powerful communicator whose primary goal is to leave places 
