 lent\, Dry Bar Comedy\, Lifetime\, BET\, Amazon Prime\,TBN\, Daystar\, USA\
 , the Word Network and Circle TV\, and been featured on SiriusXM\, the That
  Sounds Fun Podcast Tour with Annie F. Downs and USO Europe Comedy Tour.\n\
